Subject: [PATCH] feat(softmax): add exact error band composed seeds via LP
 (HiGHS)

- Implement exact band offsets and iterative LP solver (HiGHS)
- Support candidate configurations (d=3,k=3), (d=8,k=1), (d=4,k=2)
- Guarantee non-negativity to prevent Goldschmidt denominator cancellation
- Add unit tests verifying <= 1e-3 error and non-negativity across domains
